k is confirmed. Account $1,863.14, projected $1,063.02 after $800.12 listed, including held but still scheduled $103; total exceeds the $700 weekly limit. Food $122.12 remains due 4 April and no food debit is shown. $518 paid 28 March and another $518 listed 4 April are a week apart; duplication is unconfirmed. Asked Keith and Sian to check the breakdown. No new $60 or $175 debit shown and no manual payment made. Fee remains on hold. Reminders 1, 2 and 4 April."}],"done":true}

