tional $60 debit after 26 March or further $175 rent debit shown. Told Keith and chased bank. Bakery wages $581.10 versus recorded $460 weekly terms; asked Keith to check $121.10 difference. This week’s specified $57 energy, $43 loan, about $122.12 food and $518 other spending total about $740.12, above $700; Keith was previously informed. No manual payments made. Reminder set for 28 March to check account, disputed loan/rent and automatic spending; set a subsequent reminder for Monday and ahead of next Thursday as appropriate.
