day delivery, and I am not ordering stock — 961 units on the shelves. Keep watching the shop account and the books. Do not make any payments or new orders while I sort out the $650 garage debit and the 239-unit Brook shortfall with Sian and Brook. Flag anything odd, especially anything due Friday for wages."

